sequenceDiagram
    participant CS as Charging Station (Test System)
    participant CSMS as CSMS (System under Test)

    Note over CS,CSMS: Configuration: The IdToken configured as Blocked at the Test System<br>must be set as Blocked at the CSMS

    CS->>CSMS: AuthorizeRequest (idToken.idToken = <Configured blocked_idtoken_idtoken>, idToken.type = <Configured blocked_idtoken_type>)
    CSMS-->>CS: AuthorizeResponse (idTokenInfo.status = Blocked or Invalid)
    Note over CSMS: Validation: AuthorizeResponse<br>idTokenInfo.status must be Blocked or Invalid
